    {
      "text": "On the Templates page, you can manage and configure Digital Experience (ZDX) templates by adding, editing, copying, or deleting a Zscaler Managed probe. You can use the template to create an alert rule with prefilled criteria."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Prerequisites",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "Before you manage templates, ensure that:"
    },
    {
      "item": "Your admin role supports Alerts and Configuration. To learn more, see Adding ZDX Roles.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Your subscription level supports Managed Monitoring. To learn more, see Ranges & Limitations.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "heading": "Managing Templates",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "To manage your templates (Administration > Alerts > Digital Experience > Templates), you can perform the following actions:"
    },
    {
      "item": "Add a new template.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "To add a new template:",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Click New Template.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          18
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "In the Add New Template drawer, enter the required information:",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          23
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Name: Enter a name to identify the template.",
      "depth": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          4
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Severity: Select High, Medium, or Low for severity, depending on the impact of this event on users.",
      "depth": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          8
        ],
        [
          17,
          21
        ],
        [
          23,
          29
        ],
        [
          34,
          37
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Probe Type: Select Cloud Path or Web for the probe type.",
      "depth": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          10
        ],
        [
          19,
          29
        ],
        [
          33,
          36
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Criteria: Select your criteria for the template. To learn more, see Configuring an Alert Rule.",
      "depth": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          8
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Save.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          10
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Edit a template.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "To edit a template:",
      "depth": 0
