    {
      "heading": "Predefined Templates",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "To start creating alert rules for Zscaler Managed probes, there are a number of predefined templates ready for use."
    },
    {
      "text": "You cannot delete or edit predefined templates."
    },
